    "en": {
      "trackName": "Shark Hunt",
      "description": "Dive into Shark Hunt, an underwater adventure designed for Apple Watch.\n\nGuide your shark through colourful ocean environments filled with caves, tunnels, coral, hidden routes and dangerous sea creatures. Explore each chapter, collect the five gems and find your way through increasingly challenging underwater worlds.\n\nDash through the ocean, hunt fish and navigate around rocks, sea urchins, jellyfish and other hazards. Some creatures block your path, some fight back, and larger encounters demand a little more aggression.\n\nFeatures:\n• Underwater exploration built for Apple Watch\n• Multiple handcrafted chapters\n• Five gems to discover in each chapter\n• Dash movement and responsive controls\n• Fish and other sea life\n• Caves, tunnels and hidden routes\n• Jellyfish, sea urchins and other hazards\n• Larger encounters and boss battles\n• Colourful ocean environments\n• Haptic and sound feedback\n\nExplore the reef, find every gem and see how deep the hunt takes you.",
